    "body": "- like [coffeebar/neovim-project](https://github.com/coffebar/neovim-project) or [ahmedkhalf/project.nvim](https://github.com/ahmedkhalf/project.nvim)\r\n- with mini.starter support maybe?",
    "bodyHTML": "<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>like <a href=\"https://github.com/coffebar/neovim-project\">coffeebar/neovim-project</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/ahmedkhalf/project.nvim\">ahmedkhalf/project.nvim</a></li>\n<li>with mini.starter support maybe?</li>\n</ul>",
    "bodyText": "like coffeebar/neovim-project or ahmedkhalf/project.nvim\nwith mini.starter support maybe?",
